  "subject": "系统情报学研究科_全专攻",
  "text": "给定独立变数$x$和从属变数$y$的二阶常微分方程 $$y'' + a(x)y' + b(x)y = 0 \\quad (*)$$ 的两个解$y_1(x)$和$y_2(x)$，定义朗斯基行列式为 $$W(x) = \\begin{vmatrix} y_1(x) & y_2(x) \\\\ y_1'(x) & y_2'(x) \\end{vmatrix}$$\n\n(1) 证明$W(x)$满足微分方程$W' = -a(x)W$。\n\n(2) 已知$x \\geq 0$时，$a(x) = -\\frac{3x+4}{3x+1}$，$b(x) = -\\frac{6x+5}{3x+1}$，$y_1(x) = e^{-x}$，初值条件$y_2(0) = 0$，$y_2'(0) = 1$。求$W(x)$和$y_2(x)$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "二阶常微分方程",
    "朗斯基行列式",
    "方程的通解",
    "初值问题",
    "解的存在唯一性"
  ],
  "question_type": "证明与计算",
  "method": [
    "利用微分方程性质推导朗斯基行列式的微分方程",
    "求解一阶线性微分方程",
    "利用初值条件求特解"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "对朗斯基行列式求导",
    "利用原方程消去二阶导数",
    "求解$W'=-a(x)W$",
    "利用$W(x)$和初值条件求$y_2(x)$"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "wronskian_differential_equation",
    "template": "$W' + a(x)W = 0$",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(1) 证明$W' = -a(x)W$",
      "steps": [
        "计算$W'(x) = \\frac{d}{dx}\\begin{vmatrix} y_1 & y_2 \\\\ y_1' & y_2' \\end{vmatrix} = \\begin{vmatrix} y_1' & y_2' \\\\ y_1' & y_2' \\end{vmatrix} + \\begin{vmatrix} y_1 & y_2 \\\\ y_1'' & y_2'' \\end{vmatrix}$",
        "第一个行列式为0，所以$W' = \\begin{vmatrix} y_1 & y_2 \\\\ y_1'' & y_2'' \\end{vmatrix}$",
        "由微分方程$(*)$，有$y_1'' = -a(x)y_1' - b(x)y_1$和$y_2'' = -a(x)y_2' - b(x)y_2$",
        "因此$W' = \\begin{vmatrix} y_1 & y_2 \\\\ -a(x)y_1' - b(x)y_1 & -a(x)y_2' - b(x)y_2 \\end{vmatrix} = -a(x)\\begin{vmatrix} y_1 & y_2 \\\\ y_1' & y_2' \\end{vmatrix} - b(x)\\begin{vmatrix} y_1 & y_2 \\\\ y_1 & y_2 \\end{vmatrix}$",
        "由于第二个行列式为0，得$W' = -a(x)W$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2) 求$W(x)$",
      "steps": [
        "由$W' = -a(x)W = -(-\\frac{3x+4}{3x+1})W = \\frac{3x+4}{3x+1}W$",
        "这是一阶线性常微分方程，分离变量：$\\frac{dW}{W} = \\frac{3x+4}{3x+1}dx$",
        "积分：$\\ln|W| = \\int \\frac{3x+4}{3x+1}dx = \\int (1 + \\frac{1}{3x+1})dx = x + \\frac{1}{3}\\ln|3x+1| + C$",
        "因此$W(x) = A e^{x + \\frac{1}{3}\\ln(3x+1)} = A(3x+1)^{1/3}e^x$，其中$A$是常数",
        "计算初值：$W(0) = \\begin{vmatrix} y_1(0) & y_2(0) \\\\ y_1'(0) & y_2'(0) \\end{vmatrix} = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 1$",
        "因此$1 = A \\cdot 1^{1/3} \\cdot e^0 = A$，得$A = 1$",
        "所以$W(x) = (3x+1)^{1/3}e^x$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(2) 求$y_2(x)$",
      "steps": [
        "由朗斯基行列式的定义：$W(x) = y_1(x)y_2'(x) - y_1'(x)y_2(x)$",
        "代入已知值：$(3x+1)^{1/3}e^x = e^{-x}y_2'(x) - (-e^{-x})y_2(x) = e^{-x}(y_2'(x) + y_2(x))$",
        "因此$y_2'(x) + y_2(x) = (3x+1)^{1/3}e^{2x}$",
        "这是一阶线性微分方程，积分因子为$e^x$：$\\frac{d}{dx}(e^x y_2) = (3x+1)^{1/3}e^{3x}$",
        "$e^x y_2(x) = \\int (3x+1)^{1/3}e^{3x}dx + C$",
        "利用初值$y_2(0) = 0$：$0 = \\int_0^0 (3x+1)^{1/3}e^{3x}dx + C = C$，所以$C = 0$",
        "因此$y_2(x) = e^{-x}\\int_0^x (3t+1)^{1/3}e^{3t}dt$",
        "注：具体的不定积分较复杂，但上式给出了$y_2(x)$的显式表达"
      ]
    }
  ],
