          "label": "求$y_2(x)$",
          "steps": [
            "对$y'' + 2xy' + 2y = 0$，$a(x) = 2x$",
            "$W' = -2xW$，积分得$\\ln|W| = -x^2 + C$，即$W(x) = Ae^{-x^2}$",
            "由初值：$W(0) = y_1(0)y_2'(0) - y_1'(0)y_2(0) = 1 \\cdot 1 - 0 \\cdot 0 = 1$",
            "所以$W(x) = e^{-x^2}$",
            "由$W(x) = e^{-x^2}y_2'(x) - (-2x)e^{-x^2}y_2(x) = e^{-x^2}$",
            "即$y_2'(x) + 2xy_2(x) = 1$",
            "积分因子为$e^{x^2}$：$\\frac{d}{dx}(e^{x^2}y_2) = e^{x^2}$",
            "$e^{x^2}y_2(x) = \\int e^{x^2}dx + C$",
            "由$y_2(0) = 0$得$C = 0$，所以$y_2(x) = e^{-x^2}\\int_0^x e^{t^2}dt$"
